WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.083
Watch and read: For your wordwriting practice, which word should you write under a

00:00:04.083 --> 00:00:05.192
drawing of a ball?

00:00:06.033 --> 00:00:09.724
The answer is: ball. Use a clear label that names the picture.

00:00:10.533 --> 00:00:13.627
Watch and read: Choose a describing word for the mango.

00:00:14.533 --> 00:00:18.907
The answer is: yellow. A describing word tells us more about an object.
